# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shattered Lands: only original work is versioned here. Store / marketplace content (Fab, Quixel Megascans,
# MetaHumans, Unity Asset Store packs, Tripo outputs) is licensed for use in the game but not for public
# redistribution, so it stays local. See THIRD_PARTY.md for every pack and how to re-download it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unreal: generated / per-machine folders
Unreal/**/Binaries/
Unreal/**/Intermediate/
Unreal/**/Saved/
Unreal/**/DerivedDataCache/
Unreal/**/.vs/
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo

# --- Unreal: downloaded Fab sample projects (Medieval Village Megascans Sample, MetaHumans)
Unreal/Samples/
Unreal/Samples_MetaHumans/

# --- Unreal project content: keep only our own folder. Everything else in Content/ is either Epic template content
#     (recreated by unreal_tools/setup_project.ps1 from the engine) or store content copied in from Fab samples.
Unreal/ShatteredLands/Content/*
!Unreal/ShatteredLands/Content/ShatteredLands/
# ...and inside it, the store-derived assets
Unreal/ShatteredLands/Content/ShatteredLands/Store/
Unreal/ShatteredLands/Content/ShatteredLands/Characters/VikingTiers/

# --- Blender / export outputs that embed Unity Asset Store meshes or textures
models/viking_armor_tiers.blend
models/fit_tests/
unreal_export/Characters/VikingTiers/
# Tripo free-tier outputs belong to Tripo
models/tripo_download/

# --- Unity Asset Store packs extracted for reference (and their preview renders)
asset_library/unity/
asset_library/previews/

# --- Blender backups, OS and tool clutter
*.blend1
*.blend2
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
